        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "8ba7d44e-5e93-5b0c-a57d-a080ed8fbc9f",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Films: Flipper (1996), Flipper (1963), Casper, The Lord of the Rings trilogy\n- TV Series: Flipper, Home Improvement\n- People: Elijah Wood, Paul Hogan, Jessica Wesson, Peter Jackson, Zachery Ty Bryan\n- Roles: Frodo Baggins, Jennifer Sudarsky, Brad\n\nFacts:\n- The 1963 film Flipper inspired the TV series Flipper, which ran from 1964 to 1967.\n- Flipper is a 1996 adventure film remake of the 1963 film Flipper.\n- The 1996 film Flipper stars Paul Hogan and Elijah Wood.\n- Elijah Wood is best known for playing Frodo Baggins in Peter Jackson's film trilogy The Lord of the Rings, released from 2001 to 2003.\n- Jessica Wesson is known for her recurring role as Jennifer Sudarsky, Brad's first girlfriend, on the sitcom Home Improvement.\n- Brad on Home Improvement was played by Zachery Ty Bryan.\n- Jessica Wesson also had supporting roles in the Universal films Casper and Flipper in the 1990s.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "original_id": "85608b9a-7fb7-53d7-a53e-f9006347282e",
        "text": "Page: Flipper (1996 film). Sentence: Flipper is a 1996 adventure film remake of the 1963 film of the same name (which in turn begat a TV series that ran from 1964 to 1967), starring Paul Hogan and Elijah Wood.\nPage: Elijah Wood. Sentence: He is best known for his high-profile leading role as Frodo Baggins in Peter Jackson's epic film trilogy \"The Lord of the Rings\" (2001–03).\nPage: Jessica Wesson. Sentence: She is best known for her recurring role as Jennifer Sudarsky, Brad's (Zachery Ty Bryan) first girlfriend on the sitcom \"Home Improvement\", and having supporting roles in the Universal films \"Casper\" and \"Flipper\" in the 1990s.",
